{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vpOY0ypav71794363688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價跌至近三周低位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7191，較上個交易日下調24點子，是自10月22日以來的低位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價，早段都於6.67水平上落。另外人民銀行開展1,870億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠30億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.604379+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:09.859923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:37.879551+00:00","content_hash":"3d4ad6cacea0c58666e86e0200e79f864e4767529ac4d9c8a2bb2c7f3eb61bb2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.604379+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}